- **Priority 8 (alcohol)** evidence mixed; risk of oversimplification.
- **Priority 11 (CDSS)** variable effect; many trials show alert fatigue.
- Persona bias: I prioritise ED‑centric reliefs; other stakeholders (public health, social care) may rank prevention higher.
- Uncertainty: No live search performed; scores rely on cited reports up to 2023.

